    "pages": [
      {
        "source_page_id": "fukuoka-2025-general-keitobetsu-mathematics-answers-p001",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 2,
            "text": "［Ⅰ］　3つの独立小問を順に整理する",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "answer_key",
            "items": [
              {
                "label": "(i)",
                "value": "（1） \\(\\dfrac{1}{4}\\)／（2） \\(\\dfrac{125}{216}\\)"
              },
              {
                "label": "(ii)",
                "value": "（3） \\(-\\dfrac{1}{2}\\overrightarrow{\\mathrm{OA}}+\\dfrac{3}{5}\\overrightarrow{\\mathrm{OB}}+\\dfrac{2}{5}\\overrightarrow{\\mathrm{OC}}\\)／（4） \\(\\dfrac{1}{4}\\overrightarrow{\\mathrm{OC}}\\)"
              },
              {
                "label": "(iii)",
                "value": "（5） \\(k>3\\)／（6） \\(k=\\dfrac{57}{16}\\)"
              }
            ],
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "(i)　1秒後の位置で分ける",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "2秒後にBにいる道筋を、1秒後の位置A・B・Cで分けます。それぞれの道筋の確率を掛け、最後に足します。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\frac{2}{3}\\cdot\\frac{1}{6}+\\frac{1}{6}\\cdot\\frac{2}{3}+\\frac{1}{6}\\cdot\\frac{1}{6}=\\frac{1}{4}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "Bにいない頂点から次の1秒もBへ移らない確率は \\(5/6\\) です。3秒ともBを避けるので、同じ確率を3回掛けます。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\left(\\frac{5}{6}\\right)^3=\\frac{125}{216}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "(ii)　各点を基本ベクトルで表す",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "原本どおり \\(\\overrightarrow{OA}=\\vec a\\)、\\(\\overrightarrow{OB}=\\vec b\\)、\\(\\overrightarrow{OC}=\\vec c\\) と置きます。内分の条件をそのまま位置ベクトルへ直します。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\overrightarrow{OP}=\\frac12\\vec a",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\overrightarrow{OQ}=\\frac23\\vec a+\\frac13\\vec b",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\overrightarrow{OR}=\\frac35\\vec b+\\frac25\\vec c",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "求める \\(\\overrightarrow{PR}\\) は終点Rの位置ベクトルから始点Pの位置ベクトルを引きます。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\overrightarrow{PR}=\\overrightarrow{OR}-\\overrightarrow{OP}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "=-\\frac12\\overrightarrow{OA}+\\frac35\\overrightarrow{OB}+\\frac25\\overrightarrow{OC}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "fukuoka-2025-general-keitobetsu-mathematics-answers-p002",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "Sは辺OC上にあるので、まず \\(\\overrightarrow{OS}=k\\vec c\\)、\\(0\\leqq k\\leqq1\\) と置きます。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "一方、Sは平面PQR上にあるため、PからSへのベクトルを平面内の2方向PQ・PRの一次結合で表します。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\overrightarrow{PS}=x\\overrightarrow{PQ}+y\\overrightarrow{PR}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\overrightarrow{OS}=\\frac{x-3y+3}{6}\\vec a+\\frac{5x+9y}{15}\\vec b+\\frac{2y}{5}\\vec c",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "これを \\(k\\vec c\\) と比べます。基本ベクトルは1次独立なので、\\(\\vec a,\\vec b,\\vec c\\) の係数がそれぞれ一致します。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\begin{cases}\\dfrac{x-3y+3}{6}=0\\\\[4pt]\\dfrac{5x+9y}{15}=0\\\\[4pt]\\dfrac{2y}{5}=k\\end{cases}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "x=-\\frac98,\\qquad y=\\frac58,\\qquad k=\\frac14",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\overrightarrow{OS}=\\frac14\\overrightarrow{OC}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "(iii)　2本とも判別式を調べる",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "放物線と各直線の共有点は、2つの \\(y\\) を等しくしてできる2次方程式の解です。異なる2点で交わる条件は判別式が正であることです。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "C\\cap\\ell_1:\\quad x^2+2x+(3-k)=0",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\frac{D_1}{4}=1-(3-k)=k-2>0",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "C\\cap\\ell_2:\\quad x^2+2x+(4-k)=0",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "fukuoka-2025-general-keitobetsu-mathematics-answers-p003",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\frac{D_2}{4}=1-(4-k)=k-3>0",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "2条件を同時に満たす範囲は \\(k>3\\) です。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "次に4交点の四角形を台形として扱います。2次方程式 \\(x^2+2x+(3-k)=0\\) の2解の差は \\(2\\sqrt{k-2}\\) です。直線の傾きは3なので、同じ直線上の2点間距離は横の差の \\(\\sqrt{1^2+3^2}\\) 倍です。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "A_1B_1=2\\sqrt{10}\\sqrt{k-2}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "A_2B_2=2\\sqrt{10}\\sqrt{k-3}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "平行な2直線の距離は、\\(\\ell_1\\) 上の点 \\( (0,k+1) \\) と \\(\\ell_2:3x-y+k=0\\) の距離で求めます。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "d=\\frac{|-(k+1)+k|}{\\sqrt{3^2+(-1)^2}}=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{10}}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "台形の面積は、平行な2辺の和に高さを掛けて2で割ります。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "f(k)=\\frac{A_1B_1+A_2B_2}{2}\\,d",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "f(k)=\\sqrt{k-2}+\\sqrt{k-3}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "fukuoka-2025-general-keitobetsu-mathematics-answers-p004",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "面積が2という条件を代入し、\\(k>3\\) を保ったまま根号方程式を解きます。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\sqrt{k-2}+\\sqrt{k-3}=2",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\sqrt{k-2}=2-\\sqrt{k-3}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "k-2=4-4\\sqrt{k-3}+(k-3)",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\sqrt{k-3}=\\frac34",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "k=\\frac{57}{16}\\quad(>3)",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 2,
            "text": "［Ⅱ］　数列の周期と中央値の場合分け",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "answer_key",
            "items": [
              {
                "label": "(i)",
                "value": "（1） \\(\\dfrac{n+3}{6}\\)／（2） \\(-\\dfrac{1+\\sqrt{3}}{2}\\)"
              },
              {
                "label": "(ii)",
                "value": "（3） \\((6,\\ 7)\\)／（4） \\(-1105,\\ \\dfrac{7771}{1110},\\ 1117\\)"
              }
            ],
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "(i)　部分和の差から一般項を出す",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "まず \\(n=1\\) を直接計算し、\\(n\\geqq2\\) では \\(a_n=S_n-S_{n-1}\\) を使います。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "a_1=\\frac{1}{12}\\cdot1\\cdot8=\\frac23",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "a_n=\\frac{n(n+7)-(n-1)(n+6)}{12}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "a_n=\\frac{n+3}{6}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "fukuoka-2025-general-keitobetsu-mathematics-answers-p005",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "\\(a_n=(n+3)/6\\) なので、\\(\\cos(\\pi a_n)\\) は \\(n\\) を12増やすと同じ値になります。原本どおり1周期12項の和が0であることを使います。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\cos(\\pi a_{n+12})=\\cos(\\pi a_n)",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\sum_{k=1}^{12}\\cos(\\pi a_k)=0",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "2028は12の倍数なので、2028項までの和0から末尾3項を引きます。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\sum_{n=1}^{2025}\\cos(\\pi a_n)=-\\cos(\\pi a_{10})-\\cos(\\pi a_{11})-\\cos(\\pi a_{12})",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "=-\\frac{\\sqrt3}{2}-\\frac12=-\\frac{1+\\sqrt3}{2}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "(ii)　追加値の位置で中央値を分ける",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "元の10個の和は60なので平均は6です。中央の2値は6と8なので中央値は7です。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "(m,M)=(6,7)",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "追加後の平均は \\(m'=(60+a)/11\\) です。条件式を \\(a\\) と新しい中央値 \\(M'\\) の関係へ整理します。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\frac{m'-m}{M'-M}=101",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "a=1111(M'-7)+6",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "新しい中央値は、追加値が6以下なら6、6と8の間なら追加値そのもの、8以上なら8です。各範囲で解き、得た値がその範囲に入るか確かめます。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "a\\leqq6:\\quad M'=6\\Longrightarrow a=-1105",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "6<a<8:\\quad M'=a\\Longrightarrow a=\\frac{7771}{1110}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "最後の \\(8\\leqq a\\) の場合は原本次ページの計算へ続きます。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "fukuoka-2025-general-keitobetsu-mathematics-answers-p006",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "8\\leqq a:\\quad M'=8\\Longrightarrow a=1117",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "3つとも各場合の範囲条件を満たすため、すべてが答えです。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "a=-1105,\\quad\\frac{7771}{1110},\\quad1117",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 2,
            "text": "［Ⅲ］　共有点1つの条件から接線と面積へ",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "(i)　倍角公式で共有点個数を調べる",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "共有点では2曲線の \\(y\\) 座標が等しいので、まず方程式を作ります。正弦の倍角公式で \\(\\sin2x\\) の式へ直します。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\frac{1}{\\cos x}=a\\sin x",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\frac{2}{a}=\\sin2x",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "\\(0\\leqq x<\\pi/2\\) では \\(\\sin2x\\) は0から1へ増え、再び0へ下がります。水平線 \\(y=2/a\\) との交点が1つになるのは最大値1に接するときです。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\frac{2}{a}=1\\Longrightarrow a=2",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "x=\\frac{\\pi}{4},\\qquad y=\\sqrt2",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "次に \\(C_1:y=1/\\cos x\\) を微分し、接点の傾きと点を点傾きの式へ入れます。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "y'=\\frac{\\sin x}{\\cos^2x}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "y-\\sqrt2=\\sqrt2\\left(x-\\frac{\\pi}{4}\\right)",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "y=\\sqrt2x-\\frac{\\sqrt2\\pi}{4}+\\sqrt2",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "fukuoka-2025-general-keitobetsu-mathematics-answers-p007",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "(ii)　上の曲線から下の曲線を引いて積分する",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "(i)で \\(a=2\\)、交点の \\(x\\) 座標は \\(\\pi/4\\) と分かっています。原本図の網かけ部分では \\(C_1\\) が上、\\(C_2\\) が下です。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "crop",
            "asset_id": "a7-area-shaded-region",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "S=\\int_0^{\\frac{\\pi}{4}}\\left(\\frac{1}{\\cos x}-2\\sin x\\right)dx",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "原本の主たる解法どおり、\\(1/\\cos x\\) の積分では分母を \\(1-\\sin^2x\\) と見て部分分数に分けます。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\int_0^{\\frac{\\pi}{4}}\\frac{1}{\\cos x}dx=\\int_0^{\\frac{\\pi}{4}}\\frac{\\cos x}{1-\\sin^2x}dx",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "=\\frac12\\int_0^{\\frac{\\pi}{4}}\\left(\\frac{1}{1+\\sin x}+\\frac{1}{1-\\sin x}\\right)\\cos x\\,dx",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "=\\frac12\\left[\\log|1+\\sin x|-\\log|1-\\sin x|\\right]_0^{\\frac{\\pi}{4}}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "=\\log(\\sqrt2+1)",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "残る \\(2\\sin x\\) の積分と合わせて面積を確定します。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "S=\\log(\\sqrt2+1)-2[-\\cos x]_0^{\\frac{\\pi}{4}}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "S=\\log(\\sqrt2+1)+\\sqrt2-2",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "fukuoka-2025-general-keitobetsu-mathematics-answers-p008",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "原本解説の要点を確認する",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "原本解説は、(i)を方程式の実数解の個数へ帰着し、倍角公式で \\(2/a=\\sin2x\\) としてグラフと水平線の共有点個数を調べる方針を示しています。上の解説もこの順序を保っています。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "(ii)では、(i)の2曲線が接する状況を使って積分区間を決め、\\(1/\\cos x\\) の積分を部分分数と対数微分の公式で進めます。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\int\\frac{f'(x)}{f(x)}dx=\\log|f(x)|+C",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "この公式を \\(1+\\sin x\\) と \\(1-\\sin x\\) に適用することが、原本の計算を再現する要点です。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
